      "content": "St. John's Wort can interact with certain medications, including birth control pills. Taking it concurrently with hormonal birth control may increase the risk of bleeding, clotting issues, or affect its overall efficacy. It's essential to consult a healthcare professional or a pharmacist before adding St. John's Wort to your regimen, especially since you're already taking birth control pills. They can help assess the potential risks and provide guidance on a safe combination.",
