      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i cant just go to the doctor every time i want to try a vitamin lol. its kinda expensive and they usually just tell u to sleep more. is the interaction really that bad? like is it just a small risk or something? i dont want to miss my pill or anything, i just really need my mood to pick up.",
